        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International AP-PH-6681, 12 Inch Hampton Collection Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAt first glance, the Hampton Appliance Pull may not seem like a show-stopper but trust us when we say that it is. Once installed, this refrigerator handle exudes a rustic charm that is full of classic beauty. The 12 Inch Hampton Refrigerator Pull is the perfect finishing touch for your kitchen. It is designed to be able to mount vertically or horizontally. Choose from one of the beautiful finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe AP-PH-6681 Hampton Collection Appliance Pull is not just for refrigerators. Add a cohesive and look throughout your kitchen by adding them to every appliance in your home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/hampton-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-681\"><b>Matching Hampton Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Hampton Collection Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 13-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator/appliance door panel.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
